Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:36.41,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for taking so long to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:37.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Is this person...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:41.66,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(231,184)\pos(496,318)}Episode 11 "The Empty Princess Lives"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is that really Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:49.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. Her hair and manner \Nof dress are different...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.52,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,but there's no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.52,0:01:52.41,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Wait. That voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.79,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie! Is that you, Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:56.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:01.54,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister... it's you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.72,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:05.17,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She really is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:09.86,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,So you're Count Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:13.04,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Release Marie from the betrothal immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:18.08,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,If all you want is someone to give you \Nnoble children, then I should suffice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:18.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Wha—?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.52,0:02:24.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,S-Sister, it isn't that you want \Nto marry Lord Kyros, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:25.88,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.60,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,He's a piece of trash who would buy \Na woman's womb with money and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.60,0:02:29.71,Default,Marie; Kyros,0,0,0,,T-Trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:34.09,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Anastasia, why have you \Nappeared now, after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:36.96,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,B-Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:40.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There seem to be some other \Ncircumstances at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:42.36,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'll send word to Norman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:44.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,For now, please come to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:47.50,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.32,0:02:52.07,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's all right, Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:03:03.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\pos(205,11)\c&H6282E9&\3c&HEEFAFF&\bord3\fad(149,1)}Sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:03:03.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\pos(205,11)\c&H4D73ED&\3c&HEEFAFF&\bord3\blur4\fad(149,1)}Sparkling
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.81,0:03:01.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Now you're sparklingly clean, Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:03.07,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:07.54,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Is this your room, Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.00,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,It's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:11.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.53,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,We could talk tomorrow \Nafter you've slept a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.24,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.17,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I have a responsibility to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:23.59,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I... want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.48,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I've never been able to protect you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:35.38,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,How far back should I go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:40.28,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Back when you had a fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:45.85,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,{\t(3407,4700,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}That night, when Grandmother \NSasha scolded me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:56.94,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.34,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Marie has fallen asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.36,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:03.01,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.78,0:04:09.18,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Languages from so many countries...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.10,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,That's because people from many \Ncountries have sent them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:16.19,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,This is... Father's name, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:18.70,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Why are you signing it, Grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:23.15,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Because everyone is born suited for \Nsome things and not for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:29.42,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,That's true. Like me. \NI'm not smart like Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.22,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:37.12,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,You possess an inventiveness \Nthat others do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:41.18,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,It's an ability that will not \Nshine through academics alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.42,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,Grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:51.94,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Despite appearances, Gregor performs \Nmarvelously on musical instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.45,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,That path would have \Nactually been the boy's—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:02.24,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,M-Mama! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.06,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,Don't call them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.36,Flashback,young Anastasia,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.18,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,It's already far too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:23.48,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,In our era, we could not \Nchoose how to live our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:29.01,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,But the era you two will live \Nthrough will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:33.88,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,I hope that each of you will make use of \Nyour strengths and do work that you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:42.25,Flashback,Sasha,0,0,0,,That is my only wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:55.84,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,My mother has passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:58.21,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,What will happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:00.22,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.16,0:06:03.49,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,How much did you learn from my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:04.92,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Do you understand Flarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:07.59,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,I-I've only learned a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:16.67,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,She must have caught Marie's illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.10,0:06:20.85,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,Marie killed Lady Sasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:25.37,Narration,young Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,It couldn't possibly have been Marie's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:30.99,Narration,young Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,But ever since that day, Mama has \Nstopped seeing Marie as her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:35.01,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.53,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you like to try attending school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:39.40,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.37,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,It's a town school,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:44.23,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,but I hear they teach the current \Nusage of foreign languages there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.60,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You like to study, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:51.61,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I do... but won't it \Ncost money for me to attend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:55.25,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,It's all right. That's not something \Nyou need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:07:00.13,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,But the servants say they haven't received \Ntheir wages for over two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.13,0:07:03.23,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,That's because there's no \Nneed to pay the incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.19,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:07.18,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,I am the lord here. Will you defy me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:11.65,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You see? Women who get a taste of \Neducation are so quick to rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.65,0:07:13.36,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Entirely unendearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.89,0:07:15.57,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:19.84,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You are a charmless, unlovely woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:23.34,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,I am... not lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.90,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You are ugly and impudent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:28.04,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You'd never survive anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:31.63,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,The least you could do is study and\N be useful to the lord of this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:32.89,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.92,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Why would you say such awful things?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:41.65,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,Everything your father said is \Ncorrect, my lovely Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.64,0:07:46.77,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie, you understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:51.44,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You know that, though everyone loves \NAnastasia, you are {\i1}not{\i0} like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.10,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:54.61,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.24,0:07:58.96,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Dismissing the servants will \Ntake care of your tuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:01.86,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,You will do the housework. \NAnd we'll sell your dresses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:03.58,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.83,0:08:05.38,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:10.92,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,If you obey me like this, it does \Ngrant you a tiny bit of charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.09,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:19.01,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,That day, Marie's life completely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:22.57,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,She was made to work from \Ndawn until deepest night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:27.04,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,In the blink of an eye, Marie \Nbecame tattered and ragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:37.87,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Mama, why do you treat Marie like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:40.88,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,What choice do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:43.07,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,That unlucky, sinister red hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:46.30,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,Lady Sasha was cursed by that child and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:50.41,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What are you saying? What does \NGrandmother have to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:54.75,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,Ah, but then there's you, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:07.03,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,This beautiful blonde hair \Nand those blue eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:09.94,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,It's as if Lady Sasha has returned to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:14.35,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,It really is as if she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:18.52,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Mama... I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:26.87,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,Marie was in rags, but she was \Nallowed into the outside world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:31.62,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,while I was like a doll, \Ntrapped inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.65,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Confound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.47,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Why aren't more significant \Nfigures proposing marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.86,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Won't Marie be marrying anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:46.75,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,What man would ever want \Nto take her as his wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:49.01,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,But you're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.93,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,As a noble's daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.93,0:09:55.16,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,you will fulfill the vital duty of \Nmarriage like a good girl, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:07.20,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Yes. It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.70,0:10:14.66,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,The truth is, I'd like to try \Nopening up a shop in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.18,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:22.50,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,all that I'm permitted to do is \Nbe an obedient, beautiful doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.18,Flashback,Jacob,0,0,0,,Crap! Where did she run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:48.88,Flashback,Jacob,0,0,0,,That stuck-up wench... she threw herself in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.89,0:10:53.53,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Looks like I tricked him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.76,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Moron! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:28.33,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Anastasia threw herself \Ninto the river and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:50.64,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.73,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,His eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.95,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:00.66,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,A-Ana...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:05.41,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Arthur! Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.62,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,This kid seems to have some spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:12.45,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,What happened? What are you \Ndoing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:16.11,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,U-Um, well, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:18.75,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,I made up a story then and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.24,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,I lied and said I'd been sold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:26.34,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,Old Man Norman said he'd let me \Nstay at his house for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:44.78,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,C-Could it be... Do you make clothes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.68,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,Yes. I am a button artisan, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:50.69,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,Though, I'm as good as retired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:54.17,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Are you serious, old man? \NMake me your apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:55.21,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:59.98,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I like making clothes! See? I made these!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:03.87,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:09.32,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed. They're small \Nfor a man's clothes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:13.10,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,That's because they're for women to \Ndress as men! It's a hobby of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:14.96,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,T-To dress as men?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.07,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Of course, I can make regular clothes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:19.51,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Opening up a shop in the capital is my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.07,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,I don't take apprentices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:27.63,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I don't have a home or anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:30.36,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'll take care of odd jobs or whatever else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:33.99,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I want to be reborn here and \Nmake my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.55,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.39,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,You can stay here at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:48.13,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,As for my work... \Nyou'll have to watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.27,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,Every day was like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:02.41,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hey there, Norman. How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:06.87,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Sorry to cut straight to the point, but \NI'd like you to set this jewel in a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:13.67,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,This is an impressively high-quality gem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:18.16,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,The spelling for the engraving on the ring \Nis written on the request form, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:22.63,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,That won't be a problem. I'll have \Nmy apprentice read it to me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:28.86,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Oh, you've taken an apprentice? \NI guess the workshop is safe, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:39.06,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,Arthur, this is a national treasure that \NCount Granado obtained through Prince Luiphon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:43.05,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,Since you're studying the craft, \Nyou should take a look, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.38,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:53.72,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,I hear he's been searching for a striking \Nred stone to match the color of his bride's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:55.15,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Red hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:15:00.53,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,This ring is intended for the younger sister \Nof his betrothed, who died in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:05.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs26\bord2\shad0\pos(325,286)\c&H060B10&\3c&HE9F0F0&}Inscription: Marie
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.67,0:15:05.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs26\bord2\shad0\pos(325,286)\c&H060B10&\3c&HDDDDDD&\bord4\blur5}Inscription: Marie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.14,Flashback Top,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.59,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,"The dream is over."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:11.72,Narration,Anastasia; narration,0,0,0,,Reality whispered those words into my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:16.66,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:18.98,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:22.46,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Why is my big sister the only \None who gets to be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.31,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,Why do I have to take her place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:29.83,Flashback,young Marie,0,0,0,,I will never forgive my \Nsister for running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:33.86,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.66,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,There's really no possible way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:45.91,Flashback,Anastasia,0,0,0,,No, I don't feel well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:51.17,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,The letter from the count said that \NI was to bring you along, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:57.27,Flashback,Norman,0,0,0,,All right. I'll apologize to the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:05.67,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Because I don't know what I \Nshould do... my body won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:09.35,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,I know that Marie must be suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:13.31,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,I want to protect her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:19.72,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,You are the one person I most want to \Nbe able to walk your own path in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:31.95,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,So this time, I will protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.10,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.92,Flashback Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Give me the courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:52.99,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,And so you came to this castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:54.36,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.99,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie, I'm sorry it took me so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:06.33,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:08.07,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:12.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes? Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.45,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Have you just about finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:21.59,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you for letting \Nthe two of us speak alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:28.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister, I'm happy you feel the way you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:29.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:32.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You have it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.51,0:17:35.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The two of us really {\i1}are{\i0} in love!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:40.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1360,1)\an7\shad0\fs16\pos(44,62)\b1\c&HAFE497&\3c&H669C54&}Dazed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:37.83,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:40.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\shad0\fs30\pos(593,173)\c&H282933&\3c&HF4F3F3&\bord3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:40.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, why is your face \Nthat of a lovelorn maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.33,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fnTahoma\fsp5\bord1.25\shad0\pos(92,109)\c&HBF6A8F&\3c&H44162B&}Suspicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.46,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie, he's deceiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why{\i0} would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:46.46,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Because saying things is easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.47,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Especially for unscrupulous adults!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's unfathomable that \Nyou would doubt my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:54.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If money and power could \Nmake things go as I wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.94,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'd have abducted her the day I met her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:18:00.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'd destroy the Shaderan family for hurting \NMarie and go off an a journey with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:02.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,From morning 'til night, \NI'd never let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:06.43,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,If this isn't love, then why would I have \Nbought a body pillow? You dunderhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:06.43,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an2\b1\fs45\bord2\shad0\fnGeorgia\pos(316,356)\c&H5B37C5&\3c&HDCD8F8&}Marie is Life
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:14.36,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fnArial\an9\c&HEDA833&\3c&HF9EDDE&\bord1.45\move(524,65,606,65}Repulsed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:09.78,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm worried about this man \Nin a different way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:14.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, I believe that will suffice. \NEveryone is thoroughly horrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:20.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,All of this began because I wrote the \Nwrong name on my offer of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:22.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:23.07,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.65,0:18:27.43,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,But the love I feel for Marie is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:30.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No matter what hardships \Nmay rain down upon us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:33.57,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I will spend my life protecting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:37.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want to become Marie's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:43.07,Italics,Anastasia; internal,0,0,0,,Even I understand the \Ndesire to treasure family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:50.04,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Can you take responsibility for those words?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:54.60,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,If you can't, I'll steal Marie back from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:57.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I swear that the two of \Nus will find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:13.52,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie, you've been loved, as you should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:17.38,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,You've been smiling here,\Nin the place where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:23.63,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,That little girl I needed to \Nsave is gone now, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:27.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:43.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you for \Ngathering at my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:44.99,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:48.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The truth is, this is something I \Nwanted my sister to hear as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.91,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Something you want me to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:54.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's about Father's crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:58.76,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Sister, have you ever seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:03.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The prose or letters that Grandmother \Nor I wrote in Father's place...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.55,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I have seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:11.41,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,After hearing what you said, I was certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:16.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It isn't just the kingdom's tongue... \NFather can't use Flarian either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.74,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What? Is that a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:19.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:24.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Since official documents are written and \Nexchanged in Flarian, the language of the nobility,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:28.12,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,managing territory and overseeing its \Npeople would be difficult without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:33.87,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But unlike when Grandmother was here, \NFather didn't notify the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:36.42,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Instead, he simply had me \Nwrite documents on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:40.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Forgery of official documents and \Nabandonment of his duties as lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:44.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Those are my father's crimes, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.92,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:50.50,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,As a noble, who oversees the welfare \Nof his people, he has {\i1}utterly{\i0} failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:54.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,His abuse of Lady Marie and the others \Nshows his failure as a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The baron wanted to hide \Nhis own incompetence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,so he set up Marie as his \Nstand-in in an illegal manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:04.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Then he used rags and \Ntatters to chain Marie down
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:06.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,and exploit her for \Nthe sake of his noble house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:08.97,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:13.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I didn't know that doing a lord's work in their \Nstead without the crown's permission was a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:17.14,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Even if you had known, you couldn't \Nhave refused in that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:20.55,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I've already checked and found that \Nyou bear no responsibility in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.02,0:21:23.68,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,We'll be sure to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.87,0:21:30.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, you have the right to decide what \Nwill happen to the House of Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.61,0:21:36.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, please tell us what \Nit is you wish to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.10,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Until now, I've always run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:48.69,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But now I've learned that my decisions can \Nbring happiness and unhappiness to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:54.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I can't pretend not to see \Nthese things any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.43,0:21:58.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will face the truth and look \Nupon it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:01.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please allow me to make my \Ndecision after I've done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:03.73,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:05.38,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:12.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,After all, I'm of the mind to hit \Nmy parents with one good wallop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:14.13,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,M-Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.68,0:22:18.90,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,You've grown quite strong, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:20.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,to the House of Shaderan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:23:59.97,Default Top,Anastasia,0,0,0,,This is Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.56,0:24:04.89,Default Top,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Now that we sisters are together,\Nthere's only one thing for us to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.42,0:24:08.12,Default Top,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Next time, "It's Time to Settle This."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:12.08,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fs14.75\3c&H6E6C70&\fad(483,1)\pos(130,320)}Episode 12 "It's Time to Settle This"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.64,Default Top,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Let's go, Marie!
